Board-only suite: the goldens are ESP32-S3_raw ones (mem_space_*.ESP32-S3_raw.scout, .esp32_s3.ascomp), so host runs (Mac, pix, nix) skip this directory. The ESP32-S3_raw board run includes it; the STM32-L476RG_raw run skips it through STM32-L476RG_raw.skip. A host run that names it with TRIAL_SUITES still runs it (and fails: there are no host goldens).
